** Observations: **

## Authentication 

• Email and Google authentication flows were explored.  
• Different account scenarios were tested.  
• Google account switching behavior was observed.  
• Email OTP verification was tested on Web Extension and Android.  
• An issue was observed where the OTP input field did not open the keyboard after 
returning from the email application.  

##AI Chat 

• Basic AI conversations worked.  
• Different AI models were explored.  
• Character limits were tested.  
• Special characters were tested.  
• Conversation follow-up questions were tested.  
• The AI did not maintain information from previous messages within the same 
conversation.  

## Chrome Extension UI

• Welcome screen layout was inspected.  
• Settings options were explored.  
• Dark Mode availability was checked.  
• Read a Link option sometimes did not work. 
• Floating EchoGPT text actions were explored.  
• Several text actions did not produce the expected change.  

##Session Behavior 

• Logout and reopening behavior was explored.  
• Session persistence after logout was investigated. 

** Edge Cases: **

• Empty message submission  
• Very long messages  
• Messages containing special characters  
• Follow-up questions using previous context  
• Switching Google accounts  
• Returning to the application after checking OTP  
• Logging out and reopening the application  
• Network-related behavior  
• Previously deleted and re-registered accounts  

** Edge Case Testing **

| # | Edge Case | Observation |
|---:|---|---|
| 1 | Empty Message Submission | The application prevents empty message submission. |
| 2 | 4,000-Character Message | The message is accepted successfully. |
| 3 | 4,001-Character Message | The application prevents submission. |
| 4 | Special Characters | The message is processed successfully. |
| 5 | Follow-up Question | A conversation context issue was observed. |
| 6 | Google Account Switching | An account-selection issue was observed. |
| 7 | Logout → Reopen Application | Session behavior was investigated. |
| 8 | OTP Verification → Leave App → Return | The keyboard failed to appear in the OTP input field. |
| 9 | Deleted Google Account → Re-register | An authentication issue was observed. |
| 10 | Network Interruption | Application behavior during network interruption was explored. |

** Recommendations: **

• Improve conversation-context handling.  
• Make OTP verification more resilient when the user leaves and returns to the application.  
• Provide clearer loading and error states.  
• Improve Google account switching.  
• Improve the organization of Settings.  
• Improve the floating text-action experience with clear feedback.  
• Improve the welcome-screen layout.  
• Make the EchoGPT floating icon movable.
• Provide an option to minimize or close the EchoGPT floating icon.
